{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of extreme whitewater kayaking like never before in Stout Kayak! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fully immersive open-world adventure where every rapid, waterfall, and wave spots are built for pulling off epic freestyle tricks.. Paddle through wild rivers, leap off cliffs with daring stunts, and explore secret caves to collect hidden diamonds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Realistic kayak physics and dynamic water simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Perform adrenaline-pumping tricks: boof, flip, roll, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open-world exploration with weather changes and day/night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Drive your truck to the Upperlake or the Dam and choose multiple rivers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Regain your warmth by the campfires and try the Stout race slalom challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Multiple cinematic cameras can be activated for a fully immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual explorer or an extreme sports addict, Stout Kayak offers the perfect blend of chill vibes and heart-racing action. Grab your paddle crank up the music and get ready to ride the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cJoin the Stout Kayak community on Reddit! : r/StoutKayak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with other players, ask questions, share feedback, and drop your ideas. Let\u2019s build the game together!\u201d</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3910190?t=1757560912","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/0e04d505f2447b75319fd1c643cf3b51c17db948/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757560912","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/c1dbfa6176297b363313f3a785d88508c1ecf3c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757560912","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910190/c1dbfa6176297b363313f3a785d88508c1ecf3c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757560912","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the thrill of extreme whitewater kayaking like never before in Stout Kayak! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fully immersive open-world adventure where every rapid, waterfall, and wave spots are built for pulling off epic freestyle tricks.. Paddle through wild rivers, leap off cliffs with daring stunts, and explore secret caves to collect hidden diamonds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Realistic kayak physics and dynamic water simulation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Perform adrenaline-pumping tricks: boof, flip, roll, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Open-world exploration with weather changes and day/night cycle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Drive your truck to the Upperlake or the Dam and choose multiple rivers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Regain your warmth by the campfires and try the Stout race slalom challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\u00a0Multiple cinematic cameras can be activated for a fully immersive experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re a casual explorer or an extreme sports addict, Stout Kayak offers the perfect blend of chill vibes and heart-racing action. Grab your paddle crank up the music and get ready to ride the wild!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cJoin the Stout Kayak community on Reddit! : r/StoutKayak</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat with other players, ask questions, share feedback, and drop your ideas. Let\u2019s build the game together!\u201d</p>","d